{"words": [{"text": "قَالُوا۟", "translation": "They said"}, {"text": "ٱدْعُ", "translation": "Pray"}, {"text": "لَنَا", "translation": "for us"}, {"text": "رَبَّكَ", "translation": "(to) your Lord"}, {"text": "يُبَيِّن", "translation": "to make clear"}, {"text": "لَّنَا", "translation": "to us"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "هِىَ", "translation": "it (is)"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَقَرَ", "translation": "[the] cows"}, {"text": "تَشَـٰبَهَ", "translation": "look alike"}, {"text": "عَلَيْنَا", "translation": "to us"}, {"text": "وَإِنَّآ", "translation": "And indeed we"}, {"text": "إِن", "translation": "if"}, {"text": "شَآءَ", "translation": "wills"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "لَمُهْتَدُونَ", "translation": "(will) surely be those who are guided"}], "sahih": "They said, \"Call upon your Lord to make clear to us what it is. Indeed, [all] cows look alike to us. And indeed we, if Allāh wills, will be guided.\""}